# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing temperature"
msgstr "Strykingstemperatur"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature while this filament irons. The nozzle goes back to the "
"print temperature once ironing is done. 0 means no change."
msgstr ""
"Dysetemperatur mens dette filamentet stryker. Dysen går tilbake til "
"utskriftstemperaturen når strykingen er ferdig. 0 betyr ingen endring."
